      },
      {
        "type": "documentation",
        "title": "Wikipedia: Namco",
        "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Namco",
        "license": "cc",
        "accessed_at": "2026-11-26"
      },
      {
        "type": "documentation",
        "title": "Computer History Museum",
        "url": "https://www.computerhistory.org/",
        "license": "visual_reference_only",
        "accessed_at": "2026-11-26"
      }
    ],
    "intro": {
      "zh": "Galaga 街机框体是南梦宫 1981 年推出的经典街机，玩家操控战机在屏幕底部左右移动、连续射击，击退列队俯冲的蜜蜂战机阵列。其标志性的「捕获救援」机制——敌机俘获玩家战机后，玩家可救回并与之合体形成双重火力——让它成为街机黄金时代固定射击谱系中承前启后的代表作，上接《Galaxian》、下启无数空战射击游戏。",
      "en": "The Galaga arcade cabinet, released by Namco in 1981, lets players steer a fighter at the bottom of the screen to shoot down diving formations of bee-like enemy ships. Its signature capture-and-rescue mechanic—rescuing a captured fighter to combine into dual firepower—makes it a landmark of the fixed shooter lineage between Galaxian and the shmups that followed."
    },
    "era": 1981,
    "manufacturer": "Namco"
  },
